<h1>Results</h1>
This is the expected output for `mpirun -n 4 ./distributed-poisson-assembled-matrix omp 32 32 32`:

@code{.cpp}

--- Distributed Poisson Assembled Matrix Solver Results ---
Global Grid Size: 32 x 32 x 32 (32768 rows)
Num Ranks: 4
Final Residual Norm: 6.78905e-12
Iteration Count: 122

@endcode

The timings may vary depending on the machine.
